    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Four bed unfurnished two storied residence standing on c. 1 acre of landscaped gardens located in the picturesque village of Coolboy in South Wicklow. This property is c. 70kms from Dublin and within 20 minutes drive to Gorey, \r\nCo. Wexford and Arklow, Co. Wicklow.\r\nFeatures include:\r\n•\tFour bedrooms with one en-suite\r\n•\tFully fitted kitchen with modern appliances\r\n•\tSolid fuel stove in living room\r\n•\tOpen fireplace in main reception room\r\n•\tAmple off-street parking\r\n•\tLandscaped gardens\r\nIf you wish to apply kindly note the following information is required by email:\r\n \tnumber of people,\r\n \treferences,\r\n \tsome proof of ability to pay rent.\r\nPlease note pets are not permitted."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
