        "Content": "ACCOMMODATION\r\n\r\nLiving Room \t\t12'7\" (3.84m) x 12'2\" (3.71m)\r\nKitchen \t\t13'3\" (4.04m) x 12'2\" (3.71m)\r\nUtility Room \t\t10'5\" (3.18m) x 5'0\" (1.52m)\r\nDownstairs Toilet \t5'0\" (1.52m) x 2'7\" (0.79m)\r\nEntrance Hallway \t12'5\" (3.78m) x 5'1\" (1.55m)\r\nStudy \t\t\t13'8\" (4.17m) x 12'7\" (3.84m)\r\nBedroom 1 \t\t13'0\" (3.96m) x 5'7\" (1.7m)\r\nEn-Suite \t\t8'2\" (2.49m) x 3'0\" (0.91m)\r\nBedroom 2 \t\t9'4\" (2.84m) x 7'1\" (2.16m)\r\nBedroom 3 \t\t10'0\" (3.05m) x 8'1\" (2.46m)\r\nBedroom 4 \t\t8’0” (2.44m) x 9’0” (2.74m)\r\nBathroom \t\t7'8\" (2.34m) x 6'8\" (2.03m)"
